---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+18435550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(843) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Mold in Ducts | Charleston SC" description="Assessment and cleaning for mold concerns in air ducts — Charleston, SC.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Mold in Ducts</h1>
      <p>Humidity-related concerns common in the Lowcountry.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Charleston's humidity can encourage microbial growth when moisture enters the duct system. We provide visual assessment, thorough cleaning, and guidance on addressing the moisture source. Significant contamination may require specialized remediation partners.</p>
      <h2>Our Approach</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Visual inspection of accessible ducts and registers</li>
        <li>Mechanical cleaning to remove contaminated debris</li>
        <li>Optional sanitizer application</li>
        <li>Advice on humidity control and filter upgrades</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
